---
title: "increase_usd_qualification (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: self, who, deposit_usd
    q_check --> q_add_new: !self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.contains(who)
    q_check --> q_load: self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.contains(who)
    q_add_new --> [*]: self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.add(who, deposit_usd)
    q_load --> q_check_threshold: current = self.accumulated_deposit_only_usd.borrow_mut(who)
    q_check_threshold --> q_skip: *current > self.referrer_deposit_usd_threshold
    q_check_threshold --> q_accumulate: *current <= self.referrer_deposit_usd_threshold
    q_skip --> [*]: return (no-op)
    q_accumulate --> [*]: *current = *current + deposit_usd

    note right of q_check_threshold
        INV-001: Stops accumulating once current exceeds threshold
        INV-002: New users start with their first deposit as initial value
        INV-003: Accumulation is monotonically increasing until threshold exceeded
    end note
